{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lae09pTDrC1794216114.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳洲墨爾本中國籍外賣員遇襲死亡案件，當局起訴一名51歲流浪漢。</p><p></p><p>在墨爾本市中心周末有人悼念，遇襲身亡的47歲外賣員馮建明。當地警方周一發聲明指，以謀殺和故意造成嚴重傷害罪起訴疑犯。英國衛報報道，疑犯透過視像出庭，期間多次起身走動，並站在椅子上，在法庭脫褲，之後通話中斷。辯方律師指疑犯患有精神分裂。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AUS.FOLO-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TXQfIlGsqB1794216123.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>案發於周五晚，馮建明到餐廳取餐時和另一名外賣員發現，一名男子涉嫌推倒他們停放的電單車，於是上前質問，三人隨後發生衝突，馮建明被刺傷死亡，另一名外賣員送院接受治療。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.138321+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.087949+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.489383+00:00","content_hash":"2e9abf2bf662cfc96a0ce44488ff821da589b41592eb1506a13070f9d06cdcd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.138321+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}